            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Walking distance to the beach<br>- Private salt water Martini pool *Pool heating is available from October 1st through May 1st for an additional fee of $25 per day.<br>- 3 adult bikes<br>- Grill<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: Additional details coming soon!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 8):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: 2 Twin-over-Twin Bunk Beds <br>- Additional Sleeping Area: 2 Twin Beds on Landing<br><br>*Guests who are 25 years of age or younger must be accompanied by a responsible parent or guardian in any vacation rental managed by Callista by 360 Blue. We do not rent homes to those 25 years of age or younger who are unaccompanied by a responsible parent or guardian. Moreover, there must be a ratio of at least (1) parent or guardian over the age of 25 for every four (4) young adults who are 25 years of age or younger.",
